{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/title_key_art.gif?t=1726131031\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/test_header_title_en.png?t=1726131031\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/map_icon_divider.png?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>Five years ago, The Viscount and its crew set sail through The Pale Passage in search of absolute magnetic South. The ship and its crew were tragically lost to the ice, never to be seen again. Her sister ship, The Temperance shall follow in her path, hoping to find answers where The Viscount failed.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/header_frozen_wasteland_en.png?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>A polar exploration game set in an unforgiving frozen wasteland where you embark on a treacherous voyage across the ice and through the Pale Beyond. It\u2019s a stunning yet harsh landscape that can change at any moment.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/dialogue_choice_fixed.gif?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>Every decision matters and the ice doesn\u2019t care.<br><br>As the expedition unfolds and the Polar Winter approaches, every decision you make will have a meaningful impact on the story as you navigate your way across the ice.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/header_ask_to_lead_en.png?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>You didn\u2019t ask to lead this expedition, but here you are. Stuck in the ice, Captain missing, miles from civilisation. Someone has to take charge.<br><br>Manage your meagre resources, balance safety and morale, make the hard calls, and head in the only direction you can - through The Pale Beyond.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/storepage_captain_select.gif?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>Keeping the crew (and sled dogs) safe, fed, and warm during the expedition is imperative. Surviving the ice will matter little in the face of a mutiny. Every vote will count. So keep the crew on your side.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266030/extras/header_immersive_audio_en.png?t=1726131031\" /><br><br>Featuring original musical compositions, shanties and accordion tunes that will dynamically evolve alongside your journey.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/5e14eb74dadebc6840973d597b8d545fc3752690.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/037c6a13a92dc3c8ac9bf28c7506cab4f4f2dbc1.jpg"},{"name":"Act I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/494a828c7c40589c66ce22e89e5f47d44b9581b8.jpg"},{"name":"Act II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/fd9ad47c4bd5734b28bf3237bd49400ae9d1c0fc.jpg"},{"name":"Act III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/47871508f616931407078932fedf22cc70f1d7b7.jpg"},{"name":"Act IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/d4f19193652cfb5cb3abf95615bf417bc7ff24b4.jpg"},{"name":"Act V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/24955fbc98092143b0b0223e950e021127a14a8a.jpg"},{"name":"A Quest Abandoned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266030/5b212205274f80eb13c73319d60c05871b7a3865.jpg"},{"name":"A Commitment Kept","path